From: Matt deClercq <matthew.declercq@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 19:01:04 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 10/13] LibWeb: Close sealed-field plaintext channels (clone,
 type change, paste, detach); apply form-action at discovery; re-evaluate the
 directive on autocomplete change

---
